        },
        {
          "text": "Tera okwanyo wode Abram, kodi nyakware Loti wod pa Haran, gi Saray ciwode to kanyacel joweyo Ur pa Jokaldin aka jokidho i piny Kanan to jobedo kenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
